Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.00,0:05:55.00,HEADA,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\fs54\c&H8CDC4A&\an8\pos(540,24)}▍{\r\fn得意黑\fs54}2026 美网 女单 16 强
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:05:55.00,HEADB,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\fs38\c&H8CDC4A&\an8\pos(540,92)}郑钦文 {\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs44}7-{\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs44}5 {\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs44}6-{\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs44}3{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\fs38} 斯瓦泰克 · 赛后新闻发布会
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.08,0:00:01.12,EN,,0,0,0,,up in the first set.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.08,0:00:01.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,在第一盘领先的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.12,0:00:01.84,EN,,0,0,0,,Did you feel like you got
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.12,0:00:01.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,你有没有觉得自己
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.84,0:00:03.20,EN,,0,0,0,,a little bit more tense or a little bit ahead
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.84,0:00:03.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,有点紧张 或者有点
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.20,0:00:03.68,EN,,0,0,0,,of yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.20,0:00:03.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,想得太早了？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.68,0:00:04.64,EN,,0,0,0,,Just kind of what do you think led
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.68,0:00:04.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,你觉得是什么导致了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.64,0:00:06.08,EN,,0,0,0,,to that, you know, come back?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.64,0:00:06.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,她那一波反扑？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.08,0:00:07.20,EN,,0,0,0,,Honestly, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.08,0:00:07.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,说实话 没有
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.20,0:00:10.48,EN,,0,0,0,,For sure I felt like I started missing too
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.20,0:00:10.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,我确实觉得自己开始失误
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.48,0:00:11.36,EN,,0,0,0,,many shots.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.48,0:00:11.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,太多了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.36,0:00:13.52,EN,,0,0,0,,She started playing in.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.36,0:00:13.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,她开始把球打进来了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.52,0:00:16.00,EN,,0,0,0,,I let her back into into the match.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.52,0:00:16.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,是我让她回到了比赛里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.00,0:00:19.84,EN,,0,0,0,,So, no, but I honestly my focus
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.00,0:00:19.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以不是 说实话我的专注
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.84,0:00:21.36,EN,,0,0,0,,was the same as always.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.84,0:00:21.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,和平时一样
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.36,0:00:25.20,EN,,0,0,0,,I wanted to play the same as always.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.36,0:00:25.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,我想打得和平时一样
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.20,0:00:28.72,EN,,0,0,0,,Just starting to started to miss too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.20,0:00:28.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,只是开始失误太多
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.72,0:00:29.84,EN,,0,0,0,,wanted to adjust it,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.72,0:00:29.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,我想调整
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.84,0:00:32.88,EN,,0,0,0,,but nothing kind of worked at at that point.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.84,0:00:32.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,但那时候怎么调都不管用
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.88,0:00:35.28,EN,,0,0,0,,And I knew I'm going
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.88,0:00:35.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,而且我知道我还会
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.28,0:00:36.56,EN,,0,0,0,,to have, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.28,0:00:36.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,有
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.56,0:00:38.56,EN,,0,0,0,,another chance and I wanted to use it,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.56,0:00:38.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,别的机会 我也想抓住
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.56,0:00:40.64,EN,,0,0,0,,but I missed them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.56,0:00:40.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,但我一个都没兑现
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.64,0:00:41.68,EN,,0,0,0,,Eva,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.64,0:00:41.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,伊娃 请问
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.68,0:00:43.28,EN,,0,0,0,,hey, tough luck today,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.68,0:00:43.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,今天运气不太好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.28,0:00:44.88,EN,,0,0,0,,but when you're when you're up 5-1
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.28,0:00:44.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,但当你 5-1 领先的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.88,0:00:46.16,EN,,0,0,0,,and you do have that cushion,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.88,0:00:46.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,你手上有足够的缓冲
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.16,0:00:49.20,EN,,0,0,0,,h how what kind of mental adjustment
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.16,0:00:49.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,那你要做什么样的心理调整
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.20,0:00:51.84,EN,,0,0,0,,do you have to make of like it feels like you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.20,0:00:51.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,就是感觉你明明
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.84,0:00:53.44,EN,,0,0,0,,have a lot of time to get things back
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.84,0:00:53.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,有很多时间把局面拉回来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.44,0:00:55.92,EN,,0,0,0,,and then all of a sudden like
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.44,0:00:55.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,然后突然之间
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.92,0:00:57.68,EN,,0,0,0,,you don't have time?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.92,0:00:57.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,你就没时间了？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.68,0:01:00.24,EN,,0,0,0,,I never judge that I'm going to have a lot
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.68,0:01:00.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,我从不觉得自己会有
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.24,0:01:01.04,EN,,0,0,0,,of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.24,0:01:01.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,很多时间
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.04,0:01:05.52,EN,,0,0,0,,That's why I usually am able to close
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.04,0:01:05.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以我通常能用
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.52,0:01:09.36,EN,,0,0,0,,the sets with a pretty straightforward score.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.52,0:01:09.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,很直接的比分收下一盘
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.36,0:01:11.12,EN,,0,0,0,,Because I'm good
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.36,0:01:11.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为我擅长
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.12,0:01:15.44,EN,,0,0,0,,at like I don't know like even imagining
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.12,0:01:15.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,怎么说呢 就是去想象
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.44,0:01:17.52,EN,,0,0,0,,that the score line is is not like
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.44,0:01:17.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,比分并不是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.52,0:01:18.72,EN,,0,0,0,,that and just pushing
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.52,0:01:18.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,那样 然后一直往前顶
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.72,0:01:20.40,EN,,0,0,0,,and being intense all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.72,0:01:20.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,全程都保持强度
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.40,0:01:24.40,EN,,0,0,0,,But like today I I wouldn't say it
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.40,0:01:24.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,但今天我不会说
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.40,0:01:26.72,EN,,0,0,0,,had anything to do with mentality.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.40,0:01:26.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,这跟心态有什么关系
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.72,0:01:28.88,EN,,0,0,0,,It was more that I started making mistakes,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.72,0:01:28.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,更多是我开始失误
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.88,0:01:30.24,EN,,0,0,0,,you know, from easy balls
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.88,0:01:30.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,从很简单的球开始
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.24,0:01:32.56,EN,,0,0,0,,and Qinwen stopped, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.24,0:01:32.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,而郑钦文
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.56,0:01:33.68,EN,,0,0,0,,doing doing mistakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.56,0:01:33.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,不再失误了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.68,0:01:35.52,EN,,0,0,0,,She she played the balls better
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.68,0:01:35.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,她把球处理得更好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.52,0:01:40.00,EN,,0,0,0,,and yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.52,0:01:40.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,就是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.00,0:01:40.96,EN,,0,0,0,,Matt.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.00,0:01:40.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,马特 请问
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.96,0:01:42.88,EN,,0,0,0,,Hey, tough one.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.96,0:01:42.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,今天这场挺难的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.88,0:01:45.60,EN,,0,0,0,,I know New York doesn't necessarily
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.88,0:01:45.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,我知道纽约不一定
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.60,0:01:46.80,EN,,0,0,0,,like fit with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.60,0:01:46.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,很适合你
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.80,0:01:49.36,EN,,0,0,0,,you can find ita chaotic and noisy
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.80,0:01:49.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,你可能觉得这里又乱又吵
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.36,0:01:50.16,EN,,0,0,0,,and things like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.36,0:01:50.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,之类的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.16,0:01:51.76,EN,,0,0,0,,How was your comfort level here
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.16,0:01:51.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,这十天你在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.76,0:01:53.52,EN,,0,0,0,,during the past 10 days
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.76,0:01:53.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,待得舒不舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.52,0:01:55.68,EN,,0,0,0,,or so or two weeks really?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.52,0:01:55.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,或者说这两周
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.68,0:01:57.44,EN,,0,0,0,,I think it's chaotic for everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.68,0:01:57.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得对所有人都是乱的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.44,0:02:01.12,EN,,0,0,0,,So you just need to deal with it
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.44,0:02:01.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,你只需要去应付它
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.12,0:02:05.28,EN,,0,0,0,,and I've been fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.12,0:02:05.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,我一直挺好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.28,0:02:06.96,EN,,0,0,0,,Thank
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.28,0:02:06.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.96,0:02:07.84,EN,,0,0,0,,eager. I remember you saying
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.96,0:02:07.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,下一位 我记得你说过
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.84,0:02:10.16,EN,,0,0,0,,at Roland Garros that you felt very tense
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.84,0:02:10.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,你在法网说过在场上很紧张
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.16,0:02:12.48,EN,,0,0,0,,on court and it's been a bit stressful
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.16,0:02:12.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,而且最近这几个月
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.48,0:02:14.72,EN,,0,0,0,,being on the tennis tour in recent months.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.48,0:02:14.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,打巡回赛压力有点大
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.72,0:02:16.00,EN,,0,0,0,,Have you felt that here at all
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.72,0:02:16.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,你在这里有过这种感觉吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.00,0:02:18.48,EN,,0,0,0,,or do you feel you've moved on from that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.00,0:02:18.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,还是你觉得已经走出来了？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.48,0:02:20.80,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I feel like I moved on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.48,0:02:20.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,是 我觉得我走出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.80,0:02:24.16,EN,,0,0,0,,For sure it's not so easy for me
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.80,0:02:24.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,这里对我来说确实
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.16,0:02:29.12,EN,,0,0,0,,to play here as on a bit slower surface
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.16,0:02:29.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,不如慢一点的场地好打
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.12,0:02:31.92,EN,,0,0,0,,where the ball is bouncing a bit higher.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.12,0:02:31.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,就是球弹得高一些的那种
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.92,0:02:40.64,EN,,0,0,0,,But you know still I feel like I could have
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.92,0:02:40.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,但我还是觉得我本可以
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.64,0:02:43.04,EN,,0,0,0,,played a bit better so that's unfortunate.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.64,0:02:43.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,打得更好一点 挺可惜的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.04,0:02:46.40,EN,,0,0,0,,But I feel like for sure this part
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.04,0:02:46.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,不过我觉得这一段赛季
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.40,0:02:48.32,EN,,0,0,0,,of the season has been better in terms
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.40,0:02:48.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,在这方面
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.32,0:02:49.60,EN,,0,0,0,,of managing that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.32,0:02:49.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,确实处理得更好了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.60,0:02:51.04,EN,,0,0,0,,So, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.60,0:02:51.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,就是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.04,0:02:52.48,EN,,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.04,0:02:52.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.48,0:02:55.68,EN,,0,0,0,,What experiences in your career, if any,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.48,0:02:55.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,你职业生涯里有没有
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.68,0:02:57.68,EN,,0,0,0,,have been comparable to this and how
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.68,0:02:57.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,类似的经历 那时候你
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.68,0:02:59.28,EN,,0,0,0,,did you go about bouncing back
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.68,0:02:59.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,是怎么重新振作
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.28,0:03:02.16,EN,,0,0,0,,from those?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.28,0:03:02.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,起来的？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.16,0:03:05.12,EN,,0,0,0,,Honestly, every US Open except 2022
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.16,0:03:05.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,说实话 除了 2022 年
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.12,0:03:06.00,EN,,0,0,0,,has been like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.12,0:03:06.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,每一届美网都是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.00,0:03:10.32,EN,,0,0,0,,So, many like we face many losses.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.00,0:03:10.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们要面对很多次失利
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.32,0:03:15.68,EN,,0,0,0,,So obviously it's not the best thing
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.32,0:03:15.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,这话说出来可能
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.68,0:03:19.04,EN,,0,0,0,,to say, but like in tennis you're more used
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.68,0:03:19.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,不太好听 但打网球
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.04,0:03:21.20,EN,,0,0,0,,to losing than winning.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.04,0:03:21.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,你习惯输多过习惯赢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.20,0:03:23.36,EN,,0,0,0,,So I don't feel like I need
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.20,0:03:23.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以我不觉得我需要
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.36,0:03:25.04,EN,,0,0,0,,to like bounce back from anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.36,0:03:25.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,从什么里面走出来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.04,0:03:26.96,EN,,0,0,0,,Just need to focus on the work
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.04,0:03:26.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,只需要专心准备
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.96,0:03:28.24,EN,,0,0,0,,before next tournament
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.96,0:03:28.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,下一站之前的训练
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.24,0:03:30.88,EN,,0,0,0,,and there are going to be other chances
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.24,0:03:30.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,以后还会有别的机会
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.88,0:03:33.04,EN,,0,0,0,,to play good tennis and I'll focus
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.88,0:03:33.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,打出好网球 我会专注于
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.04,0:03:34.64,EN,,0,0,0,,on growing and developing my game
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.04,0:03:34.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,让自己的球继续长
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.64,0:03:36.40,EN,,0,0,0,,and that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.64,0:03:36.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,就这样
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.40,0:03:38.08,EN,,0,0,0,,I was speaking more specifically
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.40,0:03:38.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,我问的其实更具体
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.08,0:03:41.44,EN,,0,0,0,,about the first set having been up five love
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.08,0:03:41.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,是第一盘 5-0 领先那件事
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.44,0:03:43.12,EN,,0,0,0,,and bouncing back from that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.44,0:03:43.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,以及从那里面走出来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.12,0:03:44.88,EN,,0,0,0,,How do you think you'll go
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.12,0:03:44.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,你觉得你会怎么
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.88,0:03:47.12,EN,,0,0,0,,about internalizing that and growing
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.88,0:03:47.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,消化它 并且从中
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.12,0:03:48.24,EN,,0,0,0,,from it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.12,0:03:48.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,成长起来？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.24,0:03:56.40,EN,,0,0,0,,It's just one match like I'll try
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.24,0:03:56.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,就是一场球而已 我会
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.40,0:03:59.44,EN,,0,0,0,,to play the same way as usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.40,0:03:59.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,照平时那样去打
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.44,0:04:00.40,EN,,0,0,0,,What do you mean? Like
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.44,0:04:00.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,你什么意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.40,0:04:03.68,EN,,0,0,0,,do you think it's something crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.40,0:04:03.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,你觉得这有什么了不得吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.68,0:04:05.36,EN,,0,0,0,,you know, you can lose a set
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.68,0:04:05.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,任何比分下
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.36,0:04:06.80,EN,,0,0,0,,from any score.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.36,0:04:06.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,你都可能丢掉一盘
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.80,0:04:08.88,EN,,0,0,0,,So, nothing special about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.80,0:04:08.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以这没什么特别的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.88,0:04:11.04,EN,,0,0,0,,Just that's what happened and that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.88,0:04:11.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,就是这么发生了 仅此而已
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.04,0:04:12.00,EN,,0,0,0,,Okay, last question.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.04,0:04:12.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,好 最后一个问题
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.00,0:04:12.32,EN,,0,0,0,,English.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.00,0:04:12.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,用英语
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.32,0:04:15.04,EN,,0,0,0,,Tammani, just curious.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.32,0:04:15.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,请问 我就是好奇
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.04,0:04:16.56,EN,,0,0,0,,You took a medical time out
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.04,0:04:16.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,你叫了一次医疗暂停
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.56,0:04:18.80,EN,,0,0,0,,and how are you feeling physically?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.56,0:04:18.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,身体感觉怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.80,0:04:24.88,EN,,0,0,0,,Well, I've been fresher, but just little,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.80,0:04:24.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,我也有过更精神的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.88,0:04:27.60,EN,,0,0,0,,you know, my quad is quite tired,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.88,0:04:27.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,我的股四头肌很累
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.60,0:04:30.24,EN,,0,0,0,,but it had no influence on the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.60,0:04:30.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,但它对比赛没有影响
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.24,0:04:32.16,EN,,0,0,0,,just wanted to, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.24,0:04:32.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,我只是想
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.16,0:04:36.80,EN,,0,0,0,,give it a little boost, but yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.16,0:04:36.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,给它提一提劲
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.80,0:04:39.76,EN,,0,0,0,,it didn't influence anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.80,0:04:39.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,它没有影响到任何事
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.76,0:04:40.96,EN,,0,0,0,,It seemed like you've
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.76,0:04:40.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,看起来你一直
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.96,0:04:42.88,EN,,0,0,0,,been problem solving very well on court
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.96,0:04:42.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,很擅长在场上解决问题
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.88,0:04:44.32,EN,,0,0,0,,and you know, finding solutions.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.88,0:04:44.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,总能找到办法
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.32,0:04:46.40,EN,,0,0,0,,So, it did it feel kind of different today
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.32,0:04:46.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,那今天是不是不太一样
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.40,0:04:48.40,EN,,0,0,0,,that you weren't able to find a solution?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.40,0:04:48.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为你没能找到办法？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.40,0:04:50.16,EN,,0,0,0,,Well, I was just mishitting the balls,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.40,0:04:50.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,我就是没打到甜点
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.16,0:04:50.72,EN,,0,0,0,,you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.16,0:04:50.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,你知道的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.72,0:04:56.64,EN,,0,0,0,,So, didn't feel like I had space
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.72,0:04:56.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以我觉得没有空间
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.64,0:05:01.36,EN,,0,0,0,,to to feel it better.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.64,0:05:01.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,去把球感找回来
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.36,0:05:02.16,EN,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.36,0:05:02.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,我也说不好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.16,0:05:05.16,EN,,0,0,0,,Um,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.16,0:05:05.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.28,0:05:08.48,EN,,0,0,0,,well, I framed a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.28,0:05:08.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,我打到拍框上很多次
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.48,0:05:11.36,EN,,0,0,0,,I didn't hit the ball in the right place.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.48,0:05:11.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,我没把球打在对的位置上
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.36,0:05:12.16,EN,,0,0,0,,It's not so easy
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.36,0:05:12.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,而且不太容易
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.16,0:05:15.68,EN,,0,0,0,,to adjust like the basic things in the game
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.16,0:05:15.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,去调整比赛里最基本的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.68,0:05:17.68,EN,,0,0,0,,if they're not working, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.68,0:05:17.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,如果它们本来就不管用
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.68,0:05:19.04,EN,,0,0,0,,Just try to focus
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.68,0:05:19.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,只能尽量让自己专注
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.04,0:05:20.88,EN,,0,0,0,,on having like smooth rhythm
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.04,0:05:20.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,保持流畅的节奏
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.88,0:05:24.08,EN,,0,0,0,,and everything, but also, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.88,0:05:24.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,这些东西 但同时
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.08,0:05:26.08,EN,,0,0,0,,I was not I didn't have a good timing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.08,0:05:26.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,我的时机感也不好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.08,0:05:27.36,EN,,0,0,0,,I wasn't hitting the ball right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.08,0:05:27.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,我没有把球打实
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.36,0:05:30.72,EN,,0,0,0,,So, it's tough to get
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.36,0:05:30.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以很难
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.72,0:05:34.56,EN,,0,0,0,,over that when when it happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.72,0:05:34.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,在这种时候熬过去
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.56,0:05:37.76,EN,,0,0,0,,And maybe I could have
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.56,0:05:37.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,也许我本可以
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.76,0:05:39.60,EN,,0,0,0,,played more safe or something,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.76,0:05:39.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,打得更保守一些
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.60,0:05:41.60,EN,,0,0,0,,but I also didn't feel like I have space
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.60,0:05:41.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,但我也觉得面对郑钦文
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.60,0:05:43.52,EN,,0,0,0,,with Qinwen to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.60,0:05:43.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,我没有那个余地
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.52,0:05:46.32,EN,,0,0,0,,If I would be more solid
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.52,0:05:46.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,如果我能比她更稳
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.32,0:05:47.92,EN,,0,0,0,,than her, I would win this game,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.32,0:05:47.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,我就赢下这场球了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.92,0:05:49.12,EN,,0,0,0,,but I wasn't solid
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.92,0:05:49.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,但我不够稳
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.12,0:05:50.56,EN,,0,0,0,,and I was missing too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.12,0:05:50.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,我失误太多
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.56,0:05:54.24,EN,,0,0,0,,So, yeah, had like some ideas of what
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.56,0:05:54.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,我确实有过一些想法
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.24,0:05:56.30,EN,,0,0,0,,to do with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.24,0:05:56.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,想怎么去处理它
